{
  "article_id":"ch03-nfc-modes",
  "title":"NFC 運作模式",
  "chapter":"NFC 運作模式",
  "summary":"Reader/Writer、Card Emulation 與裝置對裝置交換描述不同互動情境；可用功能依平台而異。",
  "summary_refs":[{"source_id":"S08","paragraph_id":"p0049-3f564abd29"},{"source_id":"S04","paragraph_id":"p0041-dd943381b2"}],
  "claims":[
    {"text":"Android 的 Reader/Writer 模式可讀寫被動式 NFC 標籤與貼紙。","source_refs":[{"source_id":"S08","paragraph_id":"p0051-be9907b3b6"},{"source_id":"S08","paragraph_id":"p0052-d9e433da58"}]},
    {"text":"在 Card Emulation 情境中，裝置像一張 NFC 卡片，外部 Reader 可以讀取它。","source_refs":[{"source_id":"S08","paragraph_id":"p0053-5f01cd4180"},{"source_id":"S08","paragraph_id":"p0054-d10fe14ce4"},{"source_id":"S08","paragraph_id":"p0055-09dda1ff09"}]},
    {"text":"Android 4.4 起提供不經 Secure Element 的 Host-based Card Emulation 方式；這是 Android 平台能力說明。","source_refs":[{"source_id":"S04","paragraph_id":"p0041-dd943381b2"},{"source_id":"S04","paragraph_id":"p0042-a3cb05e35a"}]},
    {"text":"Android NFC 概覽提到小型資料可在兩台 Android 裝置間交換，但這不足以證明所有平台或手機都支援相同的 Peer-to-Peer 功能。","source_refs":[{"source_id":"S08","paragraph_id":"p0039-e25553f552"},{"source_id":"S08","paragraph_id":"p0040-18ee7c6246"}]}
  ],
